# Storyboard: the client's script split into spoken lines, each with its pictures (one shot per entry).
# Art direction (from unslop / impeccable / taste-skill): one bright subject per shot, quiet dressed set around it,
# one accent per set, plain copy on signs (no hype, no exclamation marks except in-world), one number format,
# decelerating arrivals (cubic-bezier .16,1,.3,1), no reflexive bounce, no looping decoration, never violet,
# no invented figures, real names as plain text only (no logos, no likenesses).
